,"source_node_id":"3","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1826044001","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"想必你一定就是塞涅小姐。果然和传闻中一样，优雅动人，令...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:4:1826044002:0":{"key":"say:4:1826044002:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1826044002","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你好。你是领主阁下的客人？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1826044003:1":{"key":"say:5:1826044003:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1826044003","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"——斯莱泽子爵。\\n很高兴认识你，塞涅小姐。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1826044004:1":{"key":"say:6:1826044004:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1826044004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"子爵……那么，你是班题斯的亡灵。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1826044005:1":{"key":"say:7:1826044005:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1826044005","action_index":"1","